        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "To make the hour clear, add the part of the day after it: **о сьомій ранку** (seven in the morning), **о сьомій вечора** (seven in the evening). This replaces a.m. and p.m., and is used more often than the twenty-four-hour form."
        },
        {
          "type": "kotak",
          "title": "The most useful time words",
          "items": [
            "**зараз** — now · **потім** — later, afterward · **спочатку** — first, at first",
            "**сьогодні** — today · **вчора** — yesterday · **завтра** — tomorrow · **післязавтра** — the day after tomorrow",
            "**рано** — early · **пізно** — late · **вчасно** — on time",
            "**завжди** — always · **часто** — often · **іноді** — sometimes · **рідко** — rarely · **ніколи не** — never",
            "⚠️ *Рано* and *пізно* are about early or late in general; *вчасно* is about being on time for something. *Я прийшов рано* = I came early. *Я прийшов вчасно* = I came on time."
          ]
        },
